[2026-11-01] r:5730402146 review COMMENTED by l0rinc (member):
I’ve just started reviewing this and wanted to clarify the overlap with #34132 before continuing.

The error handling here complements it, but there’s overlap in the index database reads: this PR throws on undecodable entries, while #34132 makes those failures fatal in CDBWrapper. It also removes `TryRead()`, which the legacy lookup here uses.

I don’t mind rebasing again if this lands first, but I’d like to clarify how we want these database-read failures handled so the two changes fit together.
